Z||000016||Eric_PA||08-10-2000||12:42 PM||||Wow, it seems there are a lot of fieros in the pa area. <BR>Rockcrawl: I just sent out the application to join the Mid Atlantic club.<P>Fiero86: I currently live in Hellertown which is part of Northampton County.<P>Gold87se: I don't exactly live in Easton but very close to it. I usually just say Allentown/Bethlehem/Easton because most people have no idea where Hellertown is. It's a small place.<P>Are any of you guys going to the swap meet at Kick Hill Farms? I'm probably going, I was there last year to pick up a HO Quad from Bob. He seems like a great guy. I figure since I need a few items he may have them there and is a good chance to give the Fiero a long drive. I'm always up for challenges.<BR>||||reg||6
